The '''Umbaran capital city''' was the [[capital]] [[city]] of [[Umbara]], the [[homeworld]] of the [[Umbaran]]s. During the [[Clone Wars]], capturing the city was the main objective for the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] at the [[Battle of Umbara]].<ref name="Darkness" /> By the end of the battle, [[Jedi General]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]]'s [[battalion]]s were able to discourage the last pockets of resistance, and secured all sectors.<ref name="Carnage">{{TCW|Carnage of Krell}}</ref>

